I've worked in property
for 14 years, and last

7
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:29,450
year we transacted on over
£30 million in property.

8
00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:32,150
I help investors get out of
underperforming property assets

9
00:00:32,150 --> 00:00:34,870
and into property assets
that work harder for them.

10
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:38,110
If you've bought something on the
advertised yield and the money landing

11
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:41,170
in your account is far less
than you expected, this is why.

12
